        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tidy Up: The Inventory Sorting Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game about <strong><u>organizing items in an inventory</u></strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ve started a part-time job at a shop that specializes in inventory sorting.<br>Customers bring in messy inventories, and it’s your job to tidy them up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful—if you mess up, customers will get angry and sales will drop.<br>Keep the shop running for 30 days without hitting zero funds!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CillMode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the main mode, running out of funds means game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But in <strong>Chill Mode</strong>, there’s no pressure — just endless inventory sorting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sit back, organize, and enjoy a relaxing time with your viewers!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tidy Up: The Inventory Sorting Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game about <strong><u>organizing items in an inventory</u></strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ve started a part-time job at a shop that specializes in inventory sorting.<br>Customers bring in messy inventories, and it’s your job to tidy them up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful—if you mess up, customers will get angry and sales will drop.<br>Keep the shop running for 30 days without hitting zero funds!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CillMode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the main mode, running out of funds means game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But in <strong>Chill Mode</strong>, there’s no pressure — just endless inventory sorting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sit back, organize, and enjoy a relaxing time with your viewers!</p>",
        "short_description": "Tidy Up is a cozy inventory-sorting game where you organize all those scattered items. Great for chill streams — relax, sort, and chat with your viewers!",
